config XTC_MSG_HUB
	tristate "XTC message hub"
	help
	  Provides the XTC message hub sysfs interface at
	  /sys/kernel/msg_hub.  Messages written by userspace are queued
	  in a bounded in-kernel FIFO and drained by readers.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here.  The module
	  will be called xtc_msg_hub.
